        <p class="hero-description">Fresh graduate with hands-on experience shipping full-stack web apps from zero to production — including a live ADHD screening app used by real users and a desktop POS system built for real business operations. Proficient in PHP, JavaScript, MySQL, and React, with extra exposure to AI/RAG pipelines.</p>
