        <p>I'm a fresh graduate in Informatics Engineering who loves turning ideas into working software. My sweet spot is <strong style="color:var(--text)">full-stack web development</strong> — building things that are functional, clean, and actually used by real people.</p>
        <p>I've shipped a live ADHD screening app used by 10–50 real users, built a desktop POS system for a fashion business, and explored AI pipelines using RAG and LangFlow. I enjoy working across the stack — from database design and backend logic to frontend UI.</p>
        <p>Outside of coding, I'm continuously learning — currently deepening my skills in modern web frameworks and AI integration to build smarter, more useful applications.</p>
